<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 26.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 26.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Wednesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- The Mozambican parliament on Tuesday approved a bill which will make membership of parliament or government incompatible with membership of a town council.</p>
<p>- Seven thousand tonnes of maize is waiting to be exported to Kenya at the port of Pemba in northern Mozambique.</p>
</text>
